      "message": "(I also updated the commit message to quite libc_tzcode\u0027s module in Android.bp better)\n\nLet me see if I understand it correctly: the macro WILDABBR is supposed to be replaced with \"\", which in Blueprint requires one level of quoting, so it\u0027s \"-DWILDABBR\u003d\\\"\\\"\",\n\nWhy is that different in Starlark?",
